DESCRIPTION:80–90km @ 128–160W\, cap at 180min — include 2×10min @ 1
 78–200W tempo blocks mid-ride to maintain quality without excessive fati
 gue load 7 days from race.\n\nReason: A 4-hour\, 120km ride only 7 days be
 fore the Half Oceanman 5\,000m swim is too heavy a load\; reducing to 3 ho
 urs preserves aerobic stimulus while ensuring the athlete arrives at race 
 week with fresh legs and shoulders.\n\nAI coaching 2026-09-08
